          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do you include meal stops in the day plan?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Breakfast near Handia, lunch at trusted Ayodhya restaurants, and a tea break on the return leg are scheduled, with special diets arranged on request."
